            "action_description": {
              "value": "Trigger: A creature within 30 feet rolls a critical failure to Strike Mugland\n\nWith a sneer, Mugland takes advantage of the opening. He makes a ranged dueling pistol or cane pistol Strike against the triggering creature. The creature is flat-footed to Mugland's attacks (including this one) until the beginning of its next turn. This attack doesn't count toward Mugland's multiple attack penalty, and his multiple attack penalty doesn't apply to this attack."
